# Master artwork. Kept on disk next to the project so the originals are findable,
# deliberately untracked: these are 2-4MB each against the ~100KB WebP the site
# actually serves, and git would carry every version of them forever. Anything
# here that the site needs has an optimised copy under public/projects/.
ref/source-art/
